  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Trim baby broccoli and halve any thicker stalks lengthways.\n• Slice zucchini into sticks.\n• Cut Japanese tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine soy sauce mix, ginger paste, the brown sugar and water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f4f5ad8e6534c49296/step-78cb0e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook baby broccoli and zucchini, tossing, until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season to taste. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f4f5ad8e6534c49296/step-ab8f7010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat and add the soy ginger mixture, turning tofu to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f4f5ad8e6534c49296/step-ea4e5720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide soy-ginger glazed tofu and garlicky stir-fried greens between plates.\n• Spoon over any remaining glaze from the pan to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80f4f5ad8e6534c49296/step-5052bb30.jpg"
    }
  ]
